### ti-orchestrator-api — proxied through the gateway at /api/v1/orchestrator/**
# Same session-cookie requirement as knowledge.http.

### Start an import (multipart upload) — returns an importId immediately, processing is async
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orchestrator/import
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary
Cookie: SESSION=<SESSION_COOKIE_VALUE>

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="questions.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

QUESTION,LEVEL,SHORT ANSWER,RESOURCE
How can we make observable applications?,A2,"Observability is the ability to measure the internal state of a system.",https://habr.com/en/companies/otus/articles/1031290/
--WebAppBoundary--

###

### Subscribe to import progress (Server-Sent Events)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orchestrator/import/subscribe/3f2504e0-4f89-11d3-9a0c-0305e82c3301
Accept: text/event-stream
Cookie: SESSION=<SESSION_COOKIE_VALUE>

###
